{"id": "unknown-2026-09-20-011", "date": "2026-09-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "From 10-97% SOC in 9 minutes: Sunwoda joins the flash charging race", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/09/sunwoda.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Chinese battery brand Sunwoda has just revealed a new EV battery charging system that can add 100 km (~62 miles) of range to an EV every minute, and can take a battery from from 10-97% SOC in less than 10 minutes. <strong>At room temperature</strong>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"china,e", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/20/from-10-97-soc-in-9-minutes-sunwoda-joins-the-flash-charging-race/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-09-20-012", "date": "2026-09-20", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 9, "week": 38, "weekday": "Sun"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "SONDORS’ abandoned 3-wheeled electric car just showed up for sale on eBay", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2017/12/p1250248-e1512156239153.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you’ve ever wanted to own a genuine piece of electric vehicle vaporware history, now might be your chance. One of the most interesting artifacts from SONDORS’ more ambitious days has just surfaced for sale on eBay: the company’s three-wheeled electric car prototype.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/09/20/sondors-forgotten-3-wheeled-electric-car-just-showed-up-for-sale-on-ebay/", "type": "rss"}]}
